  (text "Set the module CV pot to 4.25 V with no load BEFORE wiring the FB tap, and turn its CC pot fully up. 4.25 V is the hardware ceiling: both loops below can only LOWER the output."
    (at 25 178.0 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 03fd2f54-576e-46e5-a8a0-10953e39528d))
  (text "Voltage (CV): PWM from PA7, filtered by R401/C401, R402/C402, injects current into the XL4016 FB pin (1.25 V) through D401. PWM = 0 gives the ceiling; more PWM gives less voltage."
    (at 25 182.5 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 0d5b4bbe-6684-41b2-8333-742cbdb3b2e8))
  (text "Current (CC): U401A compares I_MON with ILIM and, when the charge current is above the limit, injects into FB through R405/D402. This is a hardware current limit (review item C-01)."
    (at 25 187.0 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 35f0f889-d11b-469f-a4c0-702f4bbf122c))
  (text "ILIM: PWM from PB0 through R406, with R407 to +3V3. PB0 high-Z (reset) = 3.3 V = zero current allowed. PWM 0 % = 5.6 A, 30 % = 0 A."
    (at 25 191.5 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid a497c986-3f13-4b89-aaa9-8a350486f9af))
  (text "U401B buffers SENSE_P (V_CELL), so the protection dividers and V_FAST do not load the cell (review item M-04). R409 makes \"no cell\" read 0 V."
    (at 25 196.0 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 667de5cf-65bb-469c-bc52-41dff7f40c6c))
  (text "Firmware still matches the module voltage to the cell before closing K1, then raises voltage and current targets. How it works: docs/SCHEMATIC_GUIDE.md section 4."
    (at 25 200.5 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid bbe0ef7c-9557-40dd-801c-d704c3cb8cc8)))
